{
  "info": {
    "name": "Monitoring PSV (IDMS)",
    "description": "Collection API untuk modul Monitoring PSV — pemantauan masa berlaku COI peralatan PSV/TSV.\n\n peculiarities modul ini:\n\n- Tidak ada endpoint POST. Baris monitoring lahir otomatis saat COI PSV/TSV dibuat, atau lewat POST /sync untuk backfill.\n- Tidak ada endpoint DELETE. Menghapus baris hanya menghapus anotasi; kirim null pada kolom yang ingin dikosongkan.\n- Tag Number, Masa Berlaku, Sisa Hari, dan Status Masa Berlaku dibaca LIVE dari COI dan tidak bisa diedit.\n- Hanya 4 kolom manual yang bisa di-update: status_redundant, pid_no, kategori, keterangan.\n- Status masa berlaku memakai batas <= 0, jadi tag yang jatuh tempo HARI INI sudah berstatus expired.\n- Query param status_masa_berlaku: safe | warning | expired. Nilai lain diabaikan (tidak error).\n- Sort default: sisa_hari asc (paling mendesak di atas). Kolom sort di luar whitelist diabaikan.\n\nSetelah login, token JWT otomatis disimpan ke variabel `token`, lalu dipakai untuk semua endpoint lainnya. Variabel `monitoring_psv_id` terisi otomatis dari request List.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8100", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "monitoring_psv_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autentikasi",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (ambil token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin1\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "login"] },
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.success && json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Monitoring PSV",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List (semua data)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const rows = json && json.data ? json.data.data || json.data : [];",
                  "if (Array.isArray(rows) && rows.length) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('monitoring_psv_id', rows[0].id);",
                  "  console.log('monitoring_psv_id =', rows[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv?per_page=25",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv"],
              "query": [{ "key": "per_page", "value": "25" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List (filter expired, paling mendesak)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv?status_masa_berlaku=expired&sort_by=sisa_hari&sort_order=asc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status_masa_berlaku", "value": "expired" },
                { "key": "sort_by", "value": "sisa_hari" },
                { "key": "sort_order", "value": "asc" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List (filter warning, kategori CSO)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv?status_masa_berlaku=warning&kategori=CSO",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status_masa_berlaku", "value": "warning" },
                { "key": "kategori", "value": "CSO" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List (search tag number)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv?search=PSV-177",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv"],
              "query": [{ "key": "search", "value": "PSV-177" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List (sort status masa berlaku: expired dulu)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv?sort_by=status_masa_berlaku&sort_order=asc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "sort_by", "value": "status_masa_berlaku" },
                { "key": "sort_order", "value": "asc" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Show (detail + blok COI)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv/{{monitoring_psv_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv", "{{monitoring_psv_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update (4 kolom manual)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status_redundant\": \"Redundant\",\n  \"pid_no\": \"PID-2024-0091\",\n  \"kategori\": \"CSO\",\n  \"keterangan\": \"Sudah dijadwalkan re-test\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv/{{monitoring_psv_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv", "{{monitoring_psv_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update (kosongkan anotasi)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status_redundant\": null,\n  \"pid_no\": null,\n  \"kategori\": null,\n  \"keterangan\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv/{{monitoring_psv_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv", "{{monitoring_psv_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sync (backfill / repair, idempotent)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv/sync", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv", "sync"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Dashboard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv/dashboard", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv", "dashboard"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Export Excel",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_psv/export?status_masa_berlaku=expired",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_psv", "export"],
              "query": [{ "key": "status_masa_berlaku", "value": "expired" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
